        <p>To the extent permitted by law, the App and Service are provided "as is" and "as available". We do not give express or implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, title or noninfringement, or guarantee that the App or Service will be uninterrupted, timely, secure or error-free. We do not guarantee the accuracy, reliability or suitability of the Output.</p>
        <p>These exclusions apply only where the law allows them. They do not exclude any guarantee, warranty or remedy that consumer law requires. If your local law gives you rights that cannot be waived, those rights take precedence over these Terms.</p>
