        <p>If mandatory consumer law gives you the protection of your local law or the right to bring a claim in your local courts, this section does not take those protections away. This includes applicable protections for consumers in the European Economic Area and the United Kingdom.</p>
        <p>Please contact <a href="mailto:matdo@matdolab.com">matdo@matdolab.com</a> so we can try to resolve a problem. Contacting us is not a condition of exercising your legal rights and does not extend any deadline for bringing a claim.</p>
